    "summary": "A **FLYING** unit's [taking to the skies](vsdata:core-rule/flying-models) takes effect as you pick the unit for a [normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move), an [advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move), a [fall-back](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back) or a [charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move). So for an advance or charge move, you must say the unit takes to the skies before you roll for that move.",
